      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次2400m这样从未体验过的距离\n带来的奔跑负荷太大了，\n加之她还是容易发烧的体质――",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f1df3a87a9a3955d5e3073b5426970d63bdd6bb39b22b996a91034c50d1353",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
